@host = http://localhost:5134

# Kalem
@pencil = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
# Defter
@notebook = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Sipariş ver (fiyat gönderilmez, katalogdan gelir)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "currency": "TRY",
  "lines": [
    { "productId": "{{pencil}}", "quantity": 3 },
    { "productId": "{{notebook}}", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Siparişi getir (id'yi yukarıdaki yanıttan al)
GET {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### İptal et
POST {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
